    "paragraph": "A Bayesian latent class reinforcement learning framework estimated via Variational Bayes models how dynamic travel preferences evolve alongside individual heterogeneity. Landsat and PlanetScope satellite imagery spanning 1990 to 2025 tracks land surface changes and surface urban heat island intensification in Palakkad Municipality, India using Support Vector Machine classification. Qualitative field observations, spatial analysis, and interviews with 30 real estate developers, tourism operators, and other private actors evaluate private sector engagement in heritage conservation and regeneration in Stone Town, Zanzibar.",
